{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026WKazjIO0J01791858324.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>慈雲山慈正邨有單位起火，一名住客面部燒傷，送院治理，約250人疏散。</p><p></p><p>由觀眾提供片段所見，起火單位不斷冒出濃煙，部分外牆被熏黑。清晨五時許，警方接報指正安樓一個高層單位起火，消防員很快將火救熄，約250名居民自行疏散到安全地方。起火單位一名70歲男住客面部燒傷，救出時要帶上氧氣面罩，送院時清醒。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.FIRE.TWS-0700.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20264TJZYL6CQe1791858336.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>消防初步調查，懷疑單位有外置充電器過熱，而導致火警。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-13T04:59:36.913178+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":175,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T02:14:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T04:57:55.483433+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-13T04:57:55.483433+00:00","content_hash":"789cf68f15db25043798e9531bd1da3c8467d36a22b14ebf156a598debcb1b5d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}